# Drop a PEM cert + matching key here (e.g. fleetboot.crt,
# fleetboot.key). Point FLEETBOOT_TLS_CERT + FLEETBOOT_TLS_KEY at
# /tls/fleetboot.crt + /tls/fleetboot.key in the container to enable
# HTTPS on the fleetboot service. The mount at ../fleetboot/tls in
# docker-compose.yml surfaces this directory read-only to the container.
